      "entry_id": "normal-opengl",
      "subject": "Normal_OpenGL: the mesh normal, the Normal channel and the normal derived from Height combined, encoded for the OpenGL convention (green up)",
      "status": "exact",
      "formula": "n = normalise(reoriented(normalise(reoriented(flat, H)), decode(C))) with H the height-derived normal of the texture set's method and C the Normal channel composited over (0.5, 0.5, 1); Normal_OpenGL = fma(n, 1/2, 1/2), written with the file's write rule (parity/semantics/height-to-normal.json, decisions 064 and 065).",
