          "locator": "Output templates: converted (virtual) maps"
        }
      ],
      "parameters": [
        {
          "name": "components",
          "value": 1,
          "origin": "public_documentation"
        }
      ],
      "residuals": [],
      "notes": "The calibrated operator of parity/semantics/ao-mixed.json (the AO mesh map times the AO channel, written at 8-bit precision) is exact on ao-mixed s0, s2 and s3 but misses s1 (an AO fill at opacity 0.5) by one 8-bit code at 30 values against r1 and 17 against r2, every one within 0.03 of a 2^-12 step; Painter's own r1 and r2 differ at 27 AO_Mixed values there while their AO channel exports are identical. Calibrated is not parity: the plan refuses AO_Mixed until R-086 (an opacity sweep recorded twice per session) is fitted."
    },
